+/**
+ * Added by patches/0004-display-site-translation.patch. The progress line can
+ * carry any label the server sends (`phase_started.label` is
+ * `TrimmedNonEmptyStringSchema`), so translate only the audited set of values we
+ * ship and return everything else verbatim. Without this gate an arbitrary label
+ * would be run through the dictionary's templates and corrupted (e.g.
+ * `Custom status` → `Custo 分 statu 秒`). `Running <hook>...` (a runtime-built
